<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- Pima County IDA, Ariz..</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- Pima County IDA, Ariz..</headline>
<text>
<p>THE INDUSTRIAL DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY</p>
<p>OF THE COUNTY OF PIMA (ARIZONA)</p>
<p>RE: $60,415,000</p>
<p>$30,000,000 SINGLE FAMILY MORTGAGE</p>
<p>REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1997A</p>
<p>$30,415,000 SINGLE FAMILY MORTGAGE</p>
<p>REVENUE REFUNDING BONDS, SERIES 1997B</p>
<p>Effective immediately all syndicate terms and price</p>
<p>restrictions are removed and the bonds are free to trade.</p>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes, Inc.</p>
<p>Newman and Associates, Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
